  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert Health SRHR INTPA B4 - National Expert Health SRHR INTPA B4, SL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert H&#xe4;lsa SRHR INTPA B4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert Health SRHR DEVCO B4 - the contributtion provides advice on public health and health systems and on sub-sectors, such as sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR), financing of health systems and social protection, nutrition, monitoring / evaluation, work across different sectors.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert H&#xe4;lsa SRHR DEVCO B4 - Insatsen bidrar till att ge r&#xe5;d om folkh&#xe4;lso- och h&#xe4;lsosystem och om delsektorer, s&#xe5;som sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter (SRHR), finansiering av h&#xe4;lsosystem och socialt skydd, n&#xe4;ring, &#xf6;vervakning / utv&#xe4;rdering, arbete &#xf6;ver olika sektorer.</narrative>
  </description>
